        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon-infused katana action in a fever dream Tokyo! <br><br>Dive into Tokyo's criminal underground as the feared &quot;Shinjuku Vampire&quot; Kobayashi and take out crazy lunatics for just the right price. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/2d88eff7bdccab2c13e0345dd3bcc3a3.poster.avif?t=1784923256\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/2d88eff7bdccab2c13e0345dd3bcc3a3.webm?t=1784923256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/2d88eff7bdccab2c13e0345dd3bcc3a3.mp4?t=1784923256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>・Unrelenting katana combat:</strong> Slash, stab and parry your way through hordes of monsters inspired by Japanese demons </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>・Blood is the key to survival:</strong> Use 10 different blood skills to overcome challenging enemies, then suck in their blood to replenish your health and skills </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>・Fever dream Tokyo:</strong> Explore neon-drenched renditions of real places like Shinjuku, Akihabara or Shibuya </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>・Enjoy Tokyo's nighlife:</strong> Between missions you can relax in your own apartment in Shinjuku, buy decorations and play minigames in the city hub </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/0c72bcb4a74a45d0a8a1467398239648.poster.avif?t=1784923256\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/0c72bcb4a74a45d0a8a1467398239648.webm?t=1784923256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/0c72bcb4a74a45d0a8a1467398239648.mp4?t=1784923256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>・Become Unstoppable:</strong> Upgrade your ability tree to become stronger and unlock new abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>・Hand drawn comic:</strong> A bizarre story with crazy characters brought to live in dynamic comic scenes drawn by Hans “Heavy Metal Hanzo” Steinbach </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>・Thanks, Andrew:</strong> Over 2 hour of original electronic music composed by the legendary Andrew Hulshult </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/0cc4d38576adf6a5969746c671cf6052.poster.avif?t=1784923256\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/0cc4d38576adf6a5969746c671cf6052.webm?t=1784923256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/0cc4d38576adf6a5969746c671cf6052.mp4?t=1784923256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon-infused katana action in a fever dream Tokyo! <br><br>Dive into Tokyo's criminal underground as the feared &quot;Shinjuku Vampire&quot; Kobayashi and take out crazy lunatics for just the right price. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/2d88eff7bdccab2c13e0345dd3bcc3a3.poster.avif?t=1784923256\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/2d88eff7bdccab2c13e0345dd3bcc3a3.webm?t=1784923256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/2d88eff7bdccab2c13e0345dd3bcc3a3.mp4?t=1784923256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>・Unrelenting katana combat:</strong> Slash, stab and parry your way through hordes of monsters inspired by Japanese demons </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>・Blood is the key to survival:</strong> Use 10 different blood skills to overcome challenging enemies, then suck in their blood to replenish your health and skills </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>・Fever dream Tokyo:</strong> Explore neon-drenched renditions of real places like Shinjuku, Akihabara or Shibuya </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>・Enjoy Tokyo's nighlife:</strong> Between missions you can relax in your own apartment in Shinjuku, buy decorations and play minigames in the city hub </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/0c72bcb4a74a45d0a8a1467398239648.poster.avif?t=1784923256\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/0c72bcb4a74a45d0a8a1467398239648.webm?t=1784923256\" ty